\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The running NodeStrike client (redrawn from a screenshot of a client started in a window; headless benchmark clients draw nothing). Each tick every bot moves one tile toward its goal. The server's snapshot tells each client where every other player is; the client only draws it. Each player's pale hollow square is that player's goal.\relax }}{1}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
